Cursed Archer's [[Amulet]] was given to [[Den Fears]] by the [[Huntik Foundation Council|Huntik Foundation]] in order to fight against the [[Blood Spirals]]. Den invoked Cursed Archer in the Great Rift Valley to help [[Dante Vale]]'s [[Solwing]] fight and defeat the [[Silent Soldiers|Silent Soldiers']] Titans, [[Midnight Rook]] and [[Harlekin]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

Cursed Archer was used in [[Hamelin Cathedral]] to defeat numerous [[Gremlow]] Titans with his energy arrows but was called back when the [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik]] team realized that they were seriously outnumbered. {{source|Gremlow Infestation!}}

Cursed Archer, along with Powerbonded [[Baselaird]] and [[Sabriel]] attacked [[Shakrit]] inside the volcano of [[Phoenix]]. After a tumultuous battle, Cursed Archer was defeated but bought [[Lok Lambert]] enough time to use the power of the [[Willblade]] to defeat the enemy Titan. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}

Cursed Archer was later used during Den's final battle against his brother [[Harrison]], fighting against [[Powerbonded]] [[Antedeluvian]] in the [[Blood Spiral Base]]. Cursed Archer used his arrows to create steps for Den jump off. After a fierce battle, Cursed Archer was defeated by Powerbonded Antedeluvian's Lifedrain. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}}
